{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"双幺半范畴"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“双幺半范畴”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>双幺半范畴是一个范畴 $\\mathsf C$, 带有两个"},{"Local":{"url":"幺半范畴","text":"幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":"结构 $(\\mathsf C,\\oplus,0)$, $(\\mathsf C,\\otimes,1)$, 左分配律\n$$\r\n\\delta_\\ell\\colon (B\\oplus C)\\otimes A \\overset{\\simeq}{\\longrightarrow}B\\otimes A \\oplus C \\otimes A,\r\n$$\n以及右分配律.</p>\n<p>类似于"},{"Local":{"url":"幺半范畴","text":"幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":", 可在双幺半范畴上附加严格, 对称等等条件.</p>\n"}]}}